"""
cross_vol.py — Cross Vol Builder (single file: math engine + Bloomberg + web UI + self-test)
==========================================================================================

Pick two USD legs (EURUSD, USDCAD, USDJPY, ...). The tool pulls each leg's ATM / 25d RR /
10d RR / 25d BF / 10d BF / fwd points from Bloomberg, pulls realized spot correlation,
vol-vol correlation and vol-of-correlation from BDH, lets you edit any cell or override any
input, and builds the cross surface (e.g. EURCAD).

    python cross_vol.py                 # server + browser on http://localhost:8090
    python cross_vol.py --port 9091 --no-browser
    python cross_vol.py --selftest      # numerical checks, then exit
    pip install numpy scipy blpapi      # blpapi optional: without it, placeholders load

HOW THE CROSS IS BUILT (per tenor)
----------------------------------
ATM  Variance formula  sX^2 = sA^2 + sB^2 - 2 rho_Y sA sB   (desk convention for implied vs
     realized correlation). A Gaussian copula is calibrated to reproduce it.
RR   Gaussian copula of the two legs' full risk-neutral distributions:
       - each leg smile (delta conventions, broker->smile fly solve) -> exact CDF from dsigma/dK
       - both legs expressed as "USD value of 1 unit of ccy" under the USD T-forward measure
         (USDxxx legs re-weighted by X_T/F)
       - Call(K) = E_usd[(Y_base - K Y_quote)^+] / F_Yquote  (cross forward matched exactly)
WINGS Vol-of-vol propagation. SABR (beta=1) fit to each leg -> nu_A, nu_B. Chain rule on the
     variance formula:
       (nu_X sX)^2 = (dA nu_A sA)^2 + (dB nu_B sB)^2 + 2 rho_sig (dA nu_A sA)(dB nu_B sB) + (dR sig_rho)^2
     rho_sig = correlation of the legs' vol moves, sig_rho = vol of the correlation itself.
     Weights dA sA/sX + dB sB/sX = 1, so with rho_sig = 1, sig_rho = 0, nu_X is the weighted
     average of the legs' nus. Cross SABR: nu = nu_X, alpha -> ATM, rho -> copula 25 RR.
     (The Gaussian copula's own wings are kept as a comparison; it has no tail dependence,
     so its flies come out too thin.)

SIGN CONVENTIONS
rho_quoted = correlation of the legs AS QUOTED (EURUSD/USDCAD is normally negative).
rho_Y = s_A s_B rho_quoted, s = +1 for xxxUSD, -1 for USDxxx.  RR = base-ccy calls - puts.
Vols are decimals internally, vol points on screen.
"""
